          "prompt": "<p>What is the output of the following code snippet? (a RandomAccessFile named &quot;output.txt&quot; is opened in &quot;rw&quot; mode, the byte array {65, 66, 67} is written to it, the file pointer is moved back to 0, three bytes are read into arr, and a String built from arr is printed)</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">fName</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;output.txt&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">byte</span>[] array = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">65</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">66</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">67</span>};\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">byte</span>[] arr = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">byte</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>];\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">RandomAccessFile</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RandomAccessFile</span>(fName, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rw&quot;</span>);\n    f.write(array);\n    f.seek(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>);\n    f.read(arr);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">str1</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">String</span>(arr);\n    System.out.println(str1);\n}<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (Exception e) {\n    System.out.println(e);\n}</code></pre>|||<p>Kết quả của đoạn mã sau là gì? (mở một RandomAccessFile tên &quot;output.txt&quot; ở chế độ &quot;rw&quot;, ghi mảng byte {65, 66, 67} vào file, đưa con trỏ file về vị trí 0, đọc 3 byte vào arr rồi in ra chuỗi String tạo từ arr)</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">fName</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;output.txt&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">byte</span>[] array = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">65</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">66</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">67</span>};\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">byte</span>[] arr = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">byte</span>[<span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>];\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">RandomAccessFile</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">f</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RandomAccessFile</span>(fName, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;rw&quot;</span>);\n    f.write(array);\n    f.seek(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>);\n    f.read(arr);\n    <span class=\"hljs-type\">String</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">str1</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">String</span>(arr);\n    System.out.println(str1);\n}<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> (Exception e) {\n    System.out.println(e);\n}</code></pre>",
